---
// 2 · The Descent: what "delve" means, and why the client exists.
import { chapterAttrs } from "@/data/chapters";
---

<section class="chapter descent" {...chapterAttrs("descent")}>
  <div class="descent__entry">
    <p class="entry__word" lang="en">delve</p>
    <p class="entry__pron">/dɛlv/ &middot; verb</p>
    <ol class="entry__senses">
      <li>to dig.</li>
      <li>to search deeply; to go below what is on the surface.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="entry__etym">From Old English <i lang="ang">delfan</i>, “to dig”.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="descent__prose">
    <h2>A client for going below the surface.</h2>
    <p>
      Most time in a database client is spent underneath: scrolling a table far past the first page, reading a plan,
      checking a row before you change it. That work should feel light, however deep it goes.
    </p>
    <blockquote>
      <p>
        “I wanted something which is performant, modern and consumes little ram. The existing DB clients are either
        filled with bloat (Electron and JVM) or paid. This is an alternative to them. No feature is ever going behind a
        paywall.”
      </p>
      <footer>Shayan Abbas, from the README</footer>
    </blockquote>
    <p>
      So DBDelve draws its own interface on the GPU, keeps a statement exactly as you typed it, and asks before anything
      destructive runs.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .descent {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    align-items: start;
    min-height: 110vh;
  }
  .descent__entry {
    position: sticky;
    top: 22vh;
  }
  .entry__word {
    font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 13vw, 10rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 0.85;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    margin: 0 0 0.25em;
    color: var(--color-foam);
  }
  .entry__pron {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-text-2);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .entry__senses {
    list-style: decimal;
    padding-left: 1.4em;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
  }
  .entry__senses li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4em;
  }
  .entry__etym {
    color: var(--color-text-2);
  }
  .descent__prose {
    max-width: 36rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }
  .descent__prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .descent__prose > p {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .descent blockquote {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 0 0 0 1.5rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-mint);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .descent blockquote footer {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-text-2);
  }
  @media (max-width: 959px) {
    .descent {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .descent__entry {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
